// Q-100 `quillo check` passes `js(name, ...)` with the name in a variable, which loading the program refuses (`js` needs the name written out): the program does not start
// mode: check
// open-when: ok (
// fixed-when: needs the name
// From FEEDBACK18.md §Q-100 (found on fc8bfb9). `quillo run` of this file:
// "`js` needs the name of what it calls written out, like js("Chart", ...)".

component Probe() {
    state said = "-"
    <button @click={() => {
        let name = "Math.max"
        said = str(js(name, 1, 2))
    }}>{said}</button>
}

route GET / = <html><body><Probe/></body></html>
